    {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "id": "Text-71657c4e-9af2-4c10-9c1c-868f9161da16",
        "text": "<p>A Gundi button handloom blouse, has a hand embroidered running stitch throughout it's border. Gundi buttons are used at the back for fastening. The Button loops were made by knotting. The inner side of the blouse is neatly finished with the red colored fabric leaving behind no visible seams.</p>",
        "style": "body",
        "align": "start",
        "measure": "normal",
        "layout": {
          "width": "text",
          "space": "s",
          "show": "all",
          "motion": "none"
