    {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "id": "Text-a78e7846-c04d-4ec2-87c0-1d6e07c82b65",
        "text": "<p>A Handloom Bolster cushion, made out of joining three fabric panels. It has an applique detailing with scrap fabric pieces on two of its horizontal opposite sides. The inner side of the cover is neatly finished with a contrasting fabric. The hand done running stitch lines on the two side panels is a functional detail which forms a path for the draw string. The Mother of pearl buttons on the drawstring adds on to the detailing.</p>",
        "style": "body",
        "align": "start",
        "measure": "normal",
        "layout": {
          "width": "text",
          "space": "s",
          "show": "all",
          "motion": "none"
